  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/persona-graph/peo-buyer-personas/>
    terms:modified "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:definition "The buyer personas of a professional employer organization, assembled from the Persona and Jobs models: each persona, the jobs its typical executor is trying to get done, their job steps, and the desired outcomes mapped to each job step, with their metric cards and targets. Shared by every Commercial Operations domain."@en;
    skos:note "A persona graph of the Commercial Operations assembly (design decisions D17–D24). Its resources are typed by core and domain classes and classified by taxonomy concepts."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/job-study/js-ca> terms:modified
      "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:scopeNote "Prospect companies with 5–150 employees evaluating a PEO; jobs the Client Admin performs from first enquiry to first PEO payroll."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/persona/client-admin> terms:modified
      "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:definition "The Client Admin buyer persona of a prospect evaluating a professional employer organization."@en;
    skos:scopeNote "A persona instance assembled from the Persona and Jobs models; not typed by role (Baseline decisions 22 and 23)."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/job/ca-j1> terms:modified
      "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:definition "Decide, with evidence the owners will accept, whether moving HR, payroll and benefits to a PEO lowers our cost and risk."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/job/ca-j2> terms:modified
      "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:definition "Know and predict what employing our people really costs, before and after the switch."@en;
    skos:scopeNote "Recorded in the job study as \"Related financial job\". Job kinds are functional and emotional only (Baseline decision 20): a financial job is functional with a finance subject, a social or risk job is emotional."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/job/ca-j3> terms:modified
      "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:definition "Be certain which employer obligations we keep and which the PEO takes, and that nothing falls between us."@en;
    skos:scopeNote "Recorded in the job study as \"Related emotional/risk job\". Job kinds are functional and emotional only (Baseline decision 20): a financial job is functional with a finance subject, a social or risk job is emotional."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/commercial-operations/job-step/ca-j1-1> terms:modified
      "2026-10-22T02:04:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    terms:created "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date;
    skos:note "Buyer stage: Discover. The stage is the provider's view of where this job step falls in the selling process (Baseline decision 21); it is not part of the job."@en .
  
